abstract: >
  FlowCyPy is an open-source physics-based simulation framework for flow
  cytometry. It models the measurement chain from particle populations and
  hydrodynamic focusing through light scattering, photodetection, analog
  signal conditioning, digitization, and discriminator-based event detection.

license: "MIT"

repository-code: "https://github.com/your-user/FlowCyPy"

keywords:
  - flow cytometry
  - extracellular vesicles
  - digital twin
  - light scattering
  - Mie scattering
  - simulation
  - flow cytometry calibration
  - extracellular vesicle analysis